//
// interface_id = nervus.interface.safety.control, major = 1, experimental.
//   Permission = perm.safety.observe / .rearm
//
// # The kernel implements it itself; no Provider supplies it
//
// This is **the first built-in interface**: the implementer is nervud itself (endpoint.RegisterBuiltin),
// not any Package. Callers use completely standard ResolveEndpoint → Request → Response
// and neither know nor need to know whether the other side is the kernel or an external Service.
//
